	(text "J101 pins1–100 = CM5 pins1–100. J102 pins1–100 = CM5 pins101–200.\nUse an eMMC CM5. GPIO_VREF is tied to the CM5 exported3.3V rail.\nUSB and PCIe transmit AC coupling is already on the module.\nEthernet100Ω; USB/PCIe90Ω. Preserve module envelope and mounting holes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 228.6 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
